3	line	General Wartface	Me not care what human think! Human ugly!
3	select	Select an option
3	option	Why are you arguing about the colour of your armour?
4	line	Player	Why are you arguing about the colour of your armour?
4	line	General Bentnoze	We decide to celebrate goblin new century by changing colour of our armour. Brown get boring after a bit. We want change.
4	line	General Wartface	Problem is, we can't agree on new colour. We think maybe we use old goblin tribe colours, but Bentnoze from rubbish Thorobshuun tribe and me from much better Garagorshuun tribe.
4	line	General Bentnoze	Thorobshuun tribe colour is red! Way better than silly green of Garagorshuun tribe.
4	line	General Wartface	Shut up!
4	select	Select an option
4	option	What is the goblin new century?
5	line	Player	What is the goblin new century?
5	line	General Bentnoze	Goblin century mark year of battle on Plain of Mud. That when Big High War God give goblin commandments.
5	line	Player	Big High War God?
5	line	General Wartface	Big High War God is god for goblins. He take us and make us strong, not stupid like humans.
5	line	General Bentnoze	Me bet Big High War God would pick red armour.
5	line	General Wartface	Shut up! Big High War God would hate you!
5	action	previous
4	option	Wouldn't you prefer peace?
5	line	Player	Wouldn't you prefer peace?
5	line	General Wartface	Goblins not so good at peace. Maybe peace be okay though, as long as it peace wearing green armour.
5	line	General Bentnoze	But green too much like skin. Nearly make you look naked!
5	action	previous
4	option	Do you want me to pick an armour colour for you?
