6	line	General Wartface	Green! We all wear green now, human has decided!
6	line	General Bentnoze	Why we have to do what human say? He not boss of us!
6	line	General Wartface	No but he agree with me!
6	line	General Bentnoze	That prove you a filthy human-lover!
6	line	General Wartface	Me hate humans! This human just happen to be right!
6	line	General Bentnoze	Go away human. You not know anything.
